WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:09.640
[Brotherhood 2.0 theme]

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:10.400
[BANG]

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.900
Good morning John, it's Wednesday, September 5th.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:32.460
[Guitar]

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:37.260
[Singing] Oh, Hello evil lady at the grocery store.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:41.760
It seems that you don't know what the express lane is for.

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:46.940
It says "12 items or less" but you're exempt from that I guess,

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:51.000
and you've started up an argument about coupons.

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:56.480
Oh, don't make me kill you over 25 cents.

00:00:56.960 --> 00:01:01.280
I'll give you a freaking quarter if it makes that much difference.

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:04.080
And you just remembered something you forgot to get,

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:06.680
and your husband will be right back with it.

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:09.800
Okay. That's it. I'm gonna kill you.

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:16.500
Yeah, I'm gonna kill you and possibly your whole family, too.

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:21.420
All I want is some courtesy, kindness, and maybe an apology.

00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:23.940
If you don't get out of my grocery line

00:01:23.940 --> 00:01:26.580
I'll do scorpion's fatality and rip out your spine.

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:29.760
I'm usually a very peaceful person but I'm gonna kill you.

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:35.740
I just wrote a note to the guy down the street

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:40.440
who recently invested in a giant SUV.

00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:43.240
It said "I hope you know that we're fighting a war

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:45.900
so you can get your fat ass home from the grocery store.

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:49.220
You better trade it in or I'm gonna kill you."

00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:55.400
Yeah, I'm gonna kill you with a car bomb in your H2.

00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:59.940
I don't think it'd be too much to ask for you to be a bit less of an ass.

00:01:59.940 --> 00:02:02.240
I suggest you reinvest in a Honda Fit.

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:04.900
If you don't, you're gonna regret it.

00:02:04.900 --> 00:02:07.600
I'm usually a very peaceful person, but I'm gonna kill you.

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:14.500
[Guitar]

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:19.000
It's 3 AM and my neighbour upstairs

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:23.660
is actually worse than my worst nightmares.

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:28.700
They had some friends over for some late night Red Rover,

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:32.700
and now... yeah... they're practicing tap dance.

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:38.600
[guitar]

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:43.380
Yeah, I'm gonna kill you, and all your loud-ass friends, too.

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:46.140
I don't think it'd be too much to ask

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:48.540
for you to be a bit less of an ass.

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:51.180
If I don't get some peace and quiet,

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:53.440
I'll put you on a strychnine diet.

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:56.900
I'm usually a very peaceful person,
but I'm gonna kill you.

00:02:56.920 --> 00:03:25.240
[guitar]

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:33.520
I'm really not an angry person.

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:37.140
But people just get on my nerves sometimes.

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:40.080
Thanks to Katherine for all of the help with that song,

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:42.280
particularly with coming up with the idea for it,

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:43.400
and several of the lines.

00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:45.860
So, if you want more than that, I'm afraid I can't give it to you

00:03:45.860 --> 00:03:48.280
because singing like that has made my voice a little bit weak.

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:51.680
I am not a bass. I have to work for it, and it tears it up in there.

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:55.400
My neck vein coming up, neck vein neck veeeeiinnn.

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:57.320
Anyway, I gotta go. See you tomorrow.

